<p>Hi <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>
<p>Someone asked to reset the password for your Swapper account. If it was you, use the button below. The link expires in 30 minutes.</p>
<p><a href="<%= edit_password_reset_url(@token) %>" style="display:inline-block;background:#2f5bea;color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p style="color:#6b7080;font-size:13px;">If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email; your password won't change.</p>
